Alright guys, here's the scoop,  8th level Samuri, 70hp, AC-10 STR 25.
My goodies included +0 gauntlets of power, a blessed +3 black dragon scale
mail, a stethoscope ( a very useful item ), a pick-axe (another useful item),
a pet housecat w/ 32hp, and a pet black dragon w/56hp.  I became a black dragon
and when I breathed disintegration, It bounced and killed me!!!!!!!  I refuse
to ask as to whether that is a bug or a feature, I know what it is!

Oh, by the way here's a minor spoiler
*** SPOILER ALERT ***

When you get a suit of dragon scale armor (such as wishing ie a 
'blessed +3 <color> dragon scale mail' ) and then polymorph, I did it 
by eating a chameleon,  you 'merge with your armor!'  I don't know if 
it works with rings, but it looks to me that dragon scale armor is a 
limited way of polymorph control.  But don't breath into a wall until
the above bug is fixed!  Even though you are still wearing the armor, you
seem to lose the immunity to disintegration that you normally have wearing
black dragon scale armor.


